#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:5 a60f1e266f8a4a839e320dcc7e45369c
msgid "THERMAL Mode"
msgstr "THERMAL 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:7 5594a2f923f34efdb73c5585afa20100
msgid ""
"If SOARING is enabled (:ref:`SOAR_ENABLE<SOAR_ENABLE>` = 1 and it has not "
"been disabled by an RC switch (``RCx_OPTION =88``), this mode will idle the "
"throttle, and begin circling searching for vertical lift."
msgstr ""
"如果启用了SOARING（:ref:`SOAR_ENABLE<SOAR_ENABLE>` = 1且未被RC开关（``RCx_OPTION "
"=88``）禁用），此模式将收油门并开始盘旋搜索垂直上升气流。"

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:9 810b4c8b038146979e073367ba03b6a3
msgid ""
"This is the mode that is used for autonomous soaring (See "
":ref:`soaring-4_1`) and is automatically entered if a thermal is detected "
"during the gliding portion of SOARING flight, and will begin circling "
"searching for the lift center."
msgstr ""
"此模式用于自主热气流翱翔（参见 "
":ref:`soaring-4_1`），当在SOARING飞行的滑翔阶段检测到热气流时会自动进入，并开始盘旋搜索上升中心。"

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:11 29e82c3e42a947c8a67908e716e29deb
msgid "THERMAL mode is exited under the following conditions:"
msgstr "THERMAL 模式在以下条件下退出："

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:13 fc1ef55811404858bdc5556b60751d4b
msgid ":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MAX<SOAR_ALT_MAX>` is reached."
msgstr "达到 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_MAX<SOAR_ALT_MAX>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:14 59c0aa4fa3a241acafaa4a97036e38b1
msgid ":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` is reached."
msgstr "达到 :ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:15 b5b8cd530b9f40d19734f5e2baffd7ee
msgid "Flight mode is changed by the pilot."
msgstr "飞手更改了飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:16 9e1a35f2f666435fb001750b4c25d4c8
msgid ""
"The estimate of achievable climb rate falls below "
":ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>`, and thermalling has lasted at least "
":ref:`SOAR_MIN_THML_S<SOAR_MIN_THML_S>` seconds."
msgstr ""
"可实现爬升速率的估计低于 :ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>`，且热升气流飞行已持续至少 "
":ref:`SOAR_MIN_THML_S<SOAR_MIN_THML_S>` 秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:18 0a2585c6aab64da8916c0be68617835e
msgid ""
"The aircraft drifts more than :ref:`SOAR_MAX_DRIFT<SOAR_MAX_DRIFT>` - see "
":ref:`Limit maximum distance from home<soaring_maximum-distance-from-home>`"
msgstr ""
"飞机偏移超过 :ref:`SOAR_MAX_DRIFT<SOAR_MAX_DRIFT>` —— 参见 :ref:`限制距 Home "
"的最大距离<soaring_maximum-distance-from-home>`"

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:20 2b3210510bba4845bd28230e8bbfe7c1
msgid ""
"The flight mode will be returned to whatever it was before THERMAL was "
"triggered."
msgstr "飞行模式将恢复为触发 THERMAL 之前的模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:22 1e281dcb282c42419c3be7bd43bea8ad
msgid ""
"This mode can be triggered by the pilot from any mode (like FBWA) using the "
"GCS or RC transmitter, in which case THERMAL mode will begin searching for "
"lift until THERMAL mode exit conditions are met or the pilot commands a mode"
" change"
msgstr ""
"此模式可由飞手从任何模式（如FBWA）通过GCS或遥控器触发，此时THERMAL模式将开始搜索上升气流，直到满足THERMAL模式退出条件或飞手指令模式更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:24 243d187ca25144c99ecc169d466ca4be
msgid ""
"While in THERMAL mode, the airspeed target is set to "
":ref:`SOAR_THML_ARSPD<SOAR_THML_ARSPD>` (meters/sec) if its non-zero, "
"otherwise, if \"0\" (default) it will be set to "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`."
msgstr ""
"在THERMAL模式下，如果 :ref:`SOAR_THML_ARSPD<SOAR_THML_ARSPD>` "
"非零，空速目标设置为该值（米/秒）；否则，如果为「0」（默认），将设置为 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`。"
